    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Available Immediately****Fully furnished**Sherry FitzGerald Lettings are delighted to present this newly refurbished, semi-detached three bed two bath home in the heart of Sandymount. Accommodation in brief consists of an entrance hallway leading into two very good-sized double bedrooms, one of which is ensuite and main bathroom, both with built in ample wardrobe space, washer/dryer off hallway. Upstairs there is an open plan living dining and kitchen area complete with dishwasher microwave, fridge freezer and ample cupboard space. Lovely bright living space, with third single bedroom off the hallway, additional storage space in the hallway, to the rear is a nicely enclosed patio, driveway parking for one car, Viewing is highly recommended of this beautiful home.**Professionally managed by Sherry FitzGerald Lettings**."
      },
      {
